{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00491","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 五 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九位既肃，万灵毕会。\n天门啓扄，日驭飞盖。\n焕兮棽离，傧兮暗霭。\n如山之福，惟圣时对。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}